%% Authentication (production design)
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Web
    participant API as API
    participant IdP as Identity Provider
    U->>UI: login
    UI->>IdP: credentials / OIDC (MFA at IdP)
    IdP-->>UI: token (short-lived) + refresh
    UI->>API: request + Bearer token / secure cookie
    API->>API: validate token, resolve principal
    API-->>UI: response (scoped to user)
    note over API: Syncore never bypasses MFA/OTP/CAPTCHA;\nsecrets never reach the LLM
